IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPRODQ.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PRD-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-PRD-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS PR-KEY OF PRD-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-PRD-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD PRD-FILE.
01 PRD-REC.
   COPY "BPROD".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRD-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-PRD-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-BEST PIC 9(08).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-ID PIC X(04).
01 LS-DATE PIC 9(08).
COPY "BPRODO".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-ID LS-DATE BK-PROD-OUT.
    MOVE SPACES TO PQ-REC
    MOVE "N" TO PQ-FOUND
    MOVE "00" TO PQ-RC
    MOVE 0 TO WS-BEST
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PRD-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/prod.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-PRD-PATH
    OPEN INPUT PRD-FILE
    IF WS-PRD-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO PQ-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE LS-ID TO PR-ID OF PRD-REC
    MOVE 0 TO PR-VERSION OF PRD-REC
    START PRD-FILE KEY >= PR-KEY OF PRD-REC
        INVALID KEY MOVE "23" TO PQ-RC
    END-START
    IF PQ-RC = "00"
        MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
        PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
            READ PRD-FILE NEXT RECORD
                AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
                NOT AT END PERFORM CONSIDER
            END-READ
        END-PERFORM
    END-IF
    CLOSE PRD-FILE
    IF PQ-FOUND = "Y"
        MOVE "00" TO PQ-RC
    ELSE
        MOVE "23" TO PQ-RC
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

CONSIDER.
    IF PR-ID OF PRD-REC NOT = LS-ID
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF PR-STATUS OF PRD-REC NOT = "AC"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF PR-EFF OF PRD-REC > LS-DATE
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF PQ-FOUND = "Y" AND PR-EFF OF PRD-REC <= WS-BEST
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE PR-EFF OF PRD-REC TO WS-BEST
    MOVE PRD-REC TO PQ-REC
    MOVE "Y" TO PQ-FOUND.
